    "$type": "shadow",
    "$value": "0 8px 28px -6px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.48), 0 2px 8px -2px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.40)",
    "$description": "DARK overlay shadow, strengthened (Wave 1 \u2014 Attio-calibrated): the old single 24px layer was near-invisible on the dark canvas; this two-layer ramp restores the floating cue while staying below Attio's 88px maximal ramp."
